        "exp": "縱軸刻度解析度的線性區間求值(Linear interval evaluation of y-axis scale resolution)。The implicit value of a fundamental unit grid line (Δy_grid) is defined by the interval between major labeled tick marks (ΔY_label) divided by the number of sub-divisions (n_sub). Δy_grid = ΔY_label / n_sub. Defaulting to Δy_grid = 1 without verification induces systematic read errors."
